    <!--
        Find My · View live: 17 Harrow St through binoculars (round 9). The real photo of
        the terrace, magnified and drawn by facade.luau; light, shapes, rain and the
        binoculars from facade.wgsl. Host: components/desktop/views/Facade.tsx.
          lookX, lookY  plate px at the centre of the view (head-steered)
          blur          0..1 the binoculars moving (soft plate, ghost, haze)
          glow          0..1 the phone lighting 4A
          figX          plate px, centre of the watcher's window
          figOn         0..1 the watcher
          turned        0 / 1 the watcher facing the street
          found         seconds since 4A was found, -1 before
          headX, headY  -1..1 the player's head, copied by the figure in 4A
    -->
